WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.487
Extract the complete v2 ZIP

00:00:07.487 --> 00:00:14.975
Open Original, then 00_READ_ME_FIRST.md

00:00:14.975 --> 00:00:22.462
The original package contains the complete BASIC kit, Notion import files, eight workflow playbooks, three optional JavaScript utilities, and five operating procedure documents

00:00:22.462 --> 00:00:29.950
Start with one workflow, not every file at once.

00:00:29.950 --> 00:00:35.842
Open 02_Notion_Import

00:00:35.842 --> 00:00:41.735
The Markdown home page and CSV databases can be imported into your own Notion workspace using its import controls

00:00:41.735 --> 00:00:47.628
Import each CSV as a separate database and check the headers

00:00:47.628 --> 00:00:53.521
You can also edit the CSV files in a spreadsheet without using Notion.

00:00:53.521 --> 00:00:59.017
Choose New WhatsApp inquiry in the Workflows database

00:00:59.017 --> 00:01:04.513
Set the owner to the person answering messages

00:01:04.513 --> 00:01:10.009
Set a review date and adapt the tools to your process

00:01:10.009 --> 00:01:15.505
Open the matching playbook in 03_Workflow_Playbooks

00:01:15.505 --> 00:01:21.001
Keep its sequence: verify product, check stock, draft reply, approve, then log the result.

00:01:21.001 --> 00:01:26.233
Use a fictional customer asking for a blue linen shirt

00:01:26.233 --> 00:01:31.464
Check a demo stock list, adapt a BASIC reply, and record the inquiry in a test tracker

00:01:31.464 --> 00:01:36.696
Stop if price or stock is missing

00:01:36.696 --> 00:01:41.927
Compare the result with the playbook before using the process with real customers.

00:01:41.927 --> 00:01:48.504
The three JavaScript utilities are examples for a Node.js compatible environment

00:01:48.504 --> 00:01:55.081
Read 04_Automation_Starter_Code/00_CODE_SETUP.md first

00:01:55.081 --> 00:02:01.657
The files normalize a lead, flag duplicate order references, and create an approved WhatsApp draft link

00:02:01.657 --> 00:02:08.234
They do not install a live integration or send messages

00:02:08.234 --> 00:02:14.811
Non-technical users can skip this folder.

00:02:14.811 --> 00:02:20.251
Use the AI Review Checklist from 05_AI_SOP_Library

00:02:20.251 --> 00:02:25.691
Confirm consent, factual claims, correct ownership and a recovery step

00:02:25.691 --> 00:02:31.131
Keep a human approval step and start with one test case

00:02:31.131 --> 00:02:36.571
Back up your workspace and review the workflow weekly

00:02:36.571 --> 00:02:42.011
Accounts, paid tools and custom implementation are separate.

